 behaviour and keeps uncertainty about motives and causes."},"113":{"id":"/docs/ai-features-57","page_id":"/docs/ai-features","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai-features#bot-replies","content":"**Avoid empty filler.** Skip repeated summaries, stock reassurance, forced\nprofundity and rhetorical reframing such as \"not X but Y\"."},"114":{"id":"/docs/ai-features-58","page_id":"/docs/ai-features","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai-features#bot-replies","content":"**Use old memories carefully.** Retrieved memories are treated as possibly\nrelevant historical excerpts. One is mentioned only when it clearly helps the\ncurrent topic, its timestamp is preserved, and pronoun references across\nrecords are never merged without evidence. The current message outweighs older\ncontext."},"115":{"id":"/docs/ai-features-59","page_id":"/docs/ai-features","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai-features#bot-replies","content":"Reasoning, drafts and internal commentary stay out of the reply."},"116":{"id":"/docs/ai-features-60","page_id":"/docs/ai-features","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai-features#via-admin-dashboard","content":"Open Admin Dashboard at `http://your-server:8080/admin`"},"117":{"id":"/docs/ai-features-61","page_id":"/docs/ai-features","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai-features#via-admin-dashboard","content":"Go to **AI Config** section"},"118":{"id":"/docs/ai-features-62","page_id":"/docs/ai-features","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai-features#via-admin-dashboard","content":"Toggle between **OpenAI** or **Anthropic** provider"},"119":{"id":"/docs/ai-features-63","page_id":"/docs/ai-features","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai-features#via-admin-dashboard","content":"Enter: `Base URL`, `API Key`, `Model name`"},"120":{"id":"/docs/ai-features-64","page_id":"/docs/ai-features","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai-features#via-admin-dashboard","content":"Click Save for each config"},"121":{"id":"/docs/ai-features-65","page_id":"/docs/ai-features","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai-features#running-ai-locally-ollama","content":"For full privacy, you can run local models with Ollama:"},"122":{"id":"/docs/ai-features-66","page_id":"/docs/ai-features","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai-features#running-ai-locally-ollama","content":"Install Ollama"},"123":{"id":"/docs/ai-features-67","page_id":"/docs/ai-features","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai-features#running-ai-locally-ollama","content":"Pull models:"},"124":{"id":"/docs/ai-features-68","page_id":"/docs/ai-features","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai-features#running-ai-locally-ollama","content":"In Admin Dashboard → AI Config:"},"125":{"id":"/docs/ai-features-69","page_id":"/docs/ai-features","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai-features#running-ai-locally-ollama","content":"Provider: **OpenAI**"},"126":{"id":"/docs/ai-features-70","page_id":"/docs/ai-features","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai-features#running-ai-locally-ollama","content":"Base URL: `http://host.docker.internal:11434/v1`"},"127":{"id":"/docs/ai-features-71","page_id":"/docs/ai-features","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai-features#running-ai-locally-ollama","content":"Model: `llama3.2`"},"128":{"id":"/docs/ai-features-72","page_id":"/docs/ai-features","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai-features#running-ai-locally-ollama","content":"Repeat for embedding config with model `nomic-embed-text`"},"129":{"id":"/docs/ai-features-73","page_id":"/docs/ai-features","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai-features#running-ai-locally-ollama","content":"> **Note**: Local models may be slower and less accurate than cloud APIs."},"130":{"id":"/docs/architecture","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"page","content":"Architecture","breadcrumbs":["Documentation"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture"},"131":{"id":"/docs/architecture-0","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"Mosaic system architecture ove