rchive","content":"🤖 AI Diary Archive"},"169":{"id":"/docs/changelog-17","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#-display","content":"📱 Display"},"170":{"id":"/docs/changelog-18","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#-bot-editor","content":"🤖 Bot Editor"},"171":{"id":"/docs/changelog-19","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#-fixes","content":"🐛 Fixes"},"172":{"id":"/docs/changelog-20","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#v102-2026-05-28","content":"v1.0.2 (2026-05-28)"},"173":{"id":"/docs/changelog-21","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#-performance","content":"⚡ Performance"},"174":{"id":"/docs/changelog-22","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#-bug-fixes","content":"🐛 Bug Fixes"},"175":{"id":"/docs/changelog-23","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#-refactors","content":"🔧 Refactors"},"176":{"id":"/docs/changelog-24","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#-localization","content":"🌐 Localization"},"177":{"id":"/docs/changelog-25","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#-other-mobile-improvements","content":"📱 Other Mobile Improvements"},"178":{"id":"/docs/changelog-26","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#-server","content":"🖥 Server"},"179":{"id":"/docs/changelog-27","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#v101-2026-05-22","content":"v1.0.1 (2026-05-22)"},"180":{"id":"/docs/changelog-28","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#-new-theme-system","content":"🎨 New Theme System"},"181":{"id":"/docs/changelog-29","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#-brand-new-documentation-site","content":"📖 Brand New Documentation Site"},"182":{"id":"/docs/changelog-30","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#-mobile-app-improvements","content":"📱 Mobile App Improvements"},"183":{"id":"/docs/changelog-31","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#-security--reliability","content":"🔒 Security & Reliability"},"184":{"id":"/docs/changelog-32","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#-performance-1","content":"⚡ Performance"},"185":{"id":"/docs/changelog-33","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#-other","content":"🛠 Other"},"186":{"id":"/docs/changelog-34","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#v100-2026-05-16","content":"v1.0.0 (2026-05-16)"},"187":{"id":"/docs/changelog-35","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-bot-replies","content":"**One shared rule set for first replies and follow-ups.** A bot's initial reply and every later question in a thread now use the same general conversational rules instead of separate guidance. The rules keep each persona's voice while asking the model to answer only what was actually said, leave unspoken motives unknown, skip empty filler and forced profundity, and treat retrieved memories as possibly relevant excerpts — mentioning one only when it clearly helps the current topic."},"188":{"id":"/docs/changelog-36","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-bot-replies","content":"**Calibrated memory use.** The timestamp of an older memory is preserved, and pronoun references across records are not merged without evidence. The current message outweighs older context."},"189":{"id":"/docs/changelog-37","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-mobile","content":"**Fix: smoother home input keyboard transitions.** The memo input now follows the native keyboard animation on the UI thread, reducing frame drops when the keyboard opens or closes."},"190":{"id":"/docs/changelog-38","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-mobile","content":"**Fix: filter drawer reappearing from Settings.** The search filter drawer is now mounted only while the Search tab is focused and is dismissed when leaving the screen."},"191":{"id":"/docs/changelog-39","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-mobile-1","content":"**Fix: Instant image display on new memos.** When you create a memo with images, the photos now render immediately from the local album URI instead of waiting for the server to serve them (which previously caused blank/broken thumbnails due to network + CORS latency). The grid tile shows the local asset right away, silently preloads the remote thumbnail in the background, and swaps to the remote URL the moment it finishes loading — so the image is always visible and the switch is seamless."},"192":{"id":"/docs/changelog-40","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-mobile-2","content":"**Fix: Deduplicated local push notifications.** Repeated local notifications no longer stack up for the same event."},"193":{"id":"/docs/changelog-41","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-mobile-2","content":"**Fix: Android install-package permission.** Granted `REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES` so in-app update APK installation works without manual permission grants."},"194":{"id":"/docs/changelog-42","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-mobile-2","content":"**Fix: Update badge & progress bar alignment.** The in-app update badge tap target and progress bar layout were corrected."},"195":{"id":"/docs/changelog-43","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-mobile-3","content":"**Fix: AI summary font size consistency.** The non-editable AI summary title in history/revision pager views now matches the editable variant (`fontSize: 12`)."},"196":{"id":"/docs/changelog-44","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-mobile-3","content":"**New: Download image on long press.** Long-press an image in full-screen preview to reveal a \"Save to Gallery\" button. Downloads the original quality image and saves it to your device's photo library. Requires photo library permission."},"197":{"id":"/docs/changelog-45","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-dashboard","content":"**Bot configuration management.** Bot editing has been fully migrated from the mobile app to the Dashboard (`/bots`). All bot fields — name, description, tags, auto-reply, avatar, and model — are now managed in one place."},"198":{"id":"/docs/changelog-46","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-dashboard","content":"**Model override field.** Added `model` field to the bot editor, allowing per-bot model override (empty = use system default)."},"199":{"id":"/docs/changelog-47","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-dashboard","content":"**Activity refresh polish.** Clicking refresh no longer flashes skeleton placeholders — the existing activity list stays visible while new data loads."},"200":{"id":"/docs/changelog-48","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-dashboard","content":"**Color contrast fix.** Clean Slate theme: accent foreground text changed from near-black to white for readability on the green accent background."},"201":{"id":"/docs/changelog-49","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-mobile-4","content":"**Bot list is now read-only.** Bot editing has been removed from Settings. The bot list displays name, avatar, tags, and auto-reply status with a compact pill badge (filled for Auto, outline for Manual)."},"202":{"id":"/docs/changelog-50","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-ai-diary-archive","content":"**Memo images now reach the AI.** The daily diary archive now sends memo images alongside text. Each memo gets its own AI message with its inline images, so the model can associate photos with the correct context. Budget: max 2 images per memo, 6 per diary."},"203":{"id":"/docs/changelog-51","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-ai-diary-archive","content":"**Overflow images described as text.** When image limits are exceeded, remaining images get AI-generated text descriptions appended as context — no image vanishes silently."},"204":{"id":"/docs/changelog-52","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-ai-diary-archive","content":"**Persistent image descriptions.** Uploaded images now receive an AI-generated description (`resources.ai_description` column). The diary archive reuses these stored descriptions instead of calling the vision model redundantly."},"205":{"id":"/docs/changelog-53","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-display","content":"**High-Quality Images toggle.** Settings → General. When on, memo card grids and full-screen previews show original-resolution images immediately — no thumbnails, no \"View Original\" step. When off, the original blur-to-clear LQIP flow is preserved. Persisted via on-device storage."},"206":{"id":"/docs/changelog-54","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-bot-editor","content":"FPS monitor for performance profiling"},"207":{"id":"/docs/changelog-55","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-bot-editor","content":"Description editor"},"208":{"id":"/docs/changelog-56","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#-fixes","content":"Keyboard handling improvements 