mobile app to the Dashboard (`/bots`). All bot fields — name, description, tags, auto-reply, avatar, and model — are now managed in one place."],[201,"**Bot list is now read-only.** Bot editing has been removed from Settings. The bot list displays name, avatar, tags, and auto-reply status with a compact pill badge (filled for Auto, outline for Manual)."],[811,"**Bot**"],[188,"**Calibrated memory use.** The timestamp of an older memory is preserved, and pronoun references across records are not merged without evidence. The current message outweighs older context."],[734,"**chi**"],[200,"**Color contrast fix.** Clean Slate theme: accent foreground text changed from near-black to white for readability on the green accent background."],[109,"**Context**: Bots can be configured to use memory (previous memos) via the Memory System"],[545,"**CORS is enforced**: Only configured origins can access the API"],[759,"**Database Driver**: pgx"],[838,"**Database not reachable**: Check that PostgreSQL is running and `DATABASE_URL` is correct"],[760,"**Database**: PostgreSQL + pgvector"],[95,"**Default**: Disabled"],[91,"**Default**: Enabled"],[99,"**Default**: Enabled"],[805,"**Diary**"],[112,"**Do not read minds.** An unspoken motive stays unknown. The reply describes\nobservable behaviour and keeps uncertainty about motives and causes."],[19,"**Embedding Config**: Used for generating vector embeddings for semantic search"],[244,"**Expo Go compatibility** restored (lazy-loaded native modules)"],[859,"**Feature disabled**: Check admin settings — `auto_tag_enabled` and `auto_summary_enabled` must be on"],[847,"**Firewall**: Check that your server's firewall allows the port"],[195,"**Fix: AI summary font size consistency.** The non-editable AI summary title in history/revision pager views now matches the editable variant (`fontSize: 12`)."],[193,"**Fix: Android install-package permission.** Granted `REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES` so in-app update APK installation works without manual permission grants."],[192,"**Fix: Deduplicated local push notifications.** Repeated local notifications no longer stack up for the same event."],[190,"**Fix: filter drawer reappearing from Settings.** The search filter drawer is now mounted only while the Search tab is focused and is dismissed when leaving the screen."],[191,"**Fix: Instant image display on new memos.** When you create a memo with images, the photos now render immediately from the local album URI instead of waiting for the server to serve them (which previously caused blank/broken thumbnails due to network + CORS latency). The grid tile shows the local asset right away, silently preloads the remote thumbnail in the background, and swaps to the remote URL the moment it finishes loading — so the image is always visible and the switch is seamless."],[189,"**Fix: smoother home input keyboard transitions.** The memo input now follows the native keyboard animation on the UI thread, reducing frame drops when the keyboard opens or closes."],[194,"**Fix: Update badge & progress bar alignment.** The in-app update badge tap target and progress bar layout were corrected."],[455,"**Framework**: Expo SDK 54"],[740,"**golang-jwt**"],[742,"**golang.org/x/crypto**"],[738,"**goose**"],[205,"**High-Quality Images toggle.** Settings → General. When on, memo card grids and full-screen previews show original-resolution images immediately — no thumbnails, no \"View Original\" step. When off, the original blur-to-clear LQIP flow is preserved. Persisted via on-device storage."],[848,"**HTPS**: For production, configure HTTPS via a reverse proxy (Nginx/Caddy)"],[544,"**HTTPS recommended**: In production, use a reverse proxy (Nginx, Caddy) to enable HTTPS"],[405,"**In transit**: Yes, if you configure HTTPS via a reverse proxy (see Deployment Guide)"],[279,"**Key migrations** (chronological):"],[211,"**Keyboard lag fix** — BotEditorSheet now uses `KeyboardAwareScrollView` (UI-thread native animation) instead of JS-thread `KeyboardAvoidingView`, eliminating stutter on keyboard show/hide"],[105,"**Locking**: Manual edits lock a diary against automatic regeneration"],[532,"**Memo content is sent to the AI API** for tagging, summarization, and bot replies"],[202,"**Memo images now reach the AI.** The daily diary archive now sends memo images alongside text. Each memo gets its own AI message with its inline images, so the model can associate photos with the correct context. Budget: max 2 images per memo, 6 per diary."],[802,"**Memo**"],[840,"**Missing pgvector extension**: Ensure PostgreSQL has the `vector` extension"],[198,"**Model override field.** Added `model` field to the bot editor, allowing per-bot model override (empty = use system default)."],[456,"**Navigation**: Expo Router"],[846,"**Network**: Ensure both devices are on the same network, or the server port is exposed"],[196,"**New: Download image on long press.** Long-press an image in full-screen preview to reveal a \"Save to Gallery\" button. Downloads the original quality image and saves it to your device's photo library. Requires photo library permission."],[506,"**No cloud dependency**: The only external service is the AI API you optionally configure"],[534,"**No data is sent anywhere** if you don't configure AI"],[543,"**No exposed ports required**: The server only needs port 8080 (or your configured port) exposed for the mobile app"],[505,"**No third-party access**: Mosaic has no telemetry, analytics, or phone-home features"],[187,"**One shared rule set for first replies and follow-ups.** A bot's initial reply and every later question in a thread now use the same general conversational rules instead of separate guidance. The rules keep each persona's voice while asking the model to answer only what was actually said, leave unspoken motives unknown, skip empty filler and forced profundity, and treat retrieved memories as possibly relevant excerpts — mentioning one only when it clearly helps the current topic."],[84,"**OpenAI-compatible**"],[97,"**Output**: Stored in `memo.ai_summary` field"],[203,"**Overflow images described as text.** When image limits are exceeded, remaining images get AI-generated text descriptions appended as context — no image vanishes silently."],[407,"**Passwords**: Hashed with bcrypt"],[107,"**Per-bot setting**: Each bot has an `auto_reply` toggle"],[841,"**Permission denied on storage path**: Ensure the `LOCAL_STORAGE_PATH` directory is writable"],[204,"**Persistent image descriptions.** Uploaded images now receive an AI-generated description (`resources.ai_description` column). The diary archive reuses these stored descriptions instead of calling the vision model redundantly."],[744,"**pgvector**"],[736,"**pgx**"],[839,"**Port already in use**: Change the `PORT` environment variable or stop the conflicting process"],[858,"**Rate limited**: Check your AI provider's rate limits"],[16,"**Recent activity**: A log of recent server events"],[808,"**Resource**"],[14,"**Server health**: Uptime, storage usage, database size"],[96,"**Setting**: `auto_summary_enabled`"],[92,"**Setting**: `auto_tag_enabled`"],[100,"**Settings**:"],[837,"**Solutions**:"],[457,"**State**: Zustand"],[15,"**Stats**: Total memos, diaries, resources, and bots"],[458,"**Storage**: MMKV + SQLite"],[836,"**Symptoms**: Docker container exits immediately, or `go run ./cmd/mosaic-server` fails."],[104,"**Trigger**: After a memo is created meeting the thresholds"],[108,"**Trigger**: Keyword matching on memo content"],[93,"**Trigger**: On memo creation when `tags` is empty"],[459,"**UI**: Custom components with Lucide icons"],[845,"**URL format**: Use `http://your-server-ip:8080` (include `http://` prefix)"],[114,"**Use old memories carefully.** Retrieved memories are treated as possibly\nrelevant historical excerpts. One is mentioned only when it clearly helps the\ncurrent topic, its timestamp is preserved, and pronoun references across\nrecords are never merged without evidence. The current message outw